  "name": null,
  "problem": "Write the expression for the function $(f+g)(x)$ in terms of $x.$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $(f+g)(x)\\,=\\,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}",
  "worked_solution": "We find $(f+g)(x)$ by adding the two functions:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(f+g)(x) & =(3\\sqrt{x}+2)+(2x-6) \\\\  & =2x+3\\sqrt{x}-4\\end{aligned}\n$$",
